{"title": "Greater Toughness (Condition)", "pageid": 11237, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Greater_Toughness_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status properties", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Sturdy_(Condition)\" title=\"Sturdy (Condition)\">Sturdy (Condition)</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Toughness_(Condition)\" title=\"Medium Toughness (Condition)\">Medium Toughness (Condition)</a>      </div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Greater_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Greater_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Greater_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Greater_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Greater_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Greater_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Greater Toughness Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Greater_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Greater_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3b/Greater_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Greater Toughness</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>This material is extremely strong. Only a hit that deals at least <b>50</b> damage can damage it. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/IgnoreResting\" title=\"Status properties/IgnoreResting\">IgnoreResting</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/DisableOverhead\" title=\"Status properties/DisableOverhead\">DisableOverhead</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Greater_Toughness\">Sources of Greater Toughness</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Possessed by some <a href=\"/wiki/Container\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Container\">containers</a>, doors, and other environmental objects.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The damage threshold is evaluated for each individual hit. An attack with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Missile\" title=\"Magic Missile\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp/20px-Magic_Missile_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp/30px-Magic_Missile_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp/40px-Magic_Missile_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Missile\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp/20px-Magic_Missile_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Missile\" title=\"Magic Missile\">Magic Missile</a> where each missile deals its maximum of <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">5</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"force\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">force</span></a> will never deal any damage to an object or creature with this condition, even if the sum total exceeds the threshold.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203220\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.044 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.047 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1346/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 11984/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5466/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.016/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 976664/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   39.309      1 -total\n 97.91%   38.488      1 Template:Condition_page\n 44.87%   17.639      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 18.42%    7.239      3 Template:Icon_link\n 17.31%    6.804      3 Template:Icon_text\n 16.76%    6.587      2 Temp